{"watch":13,"start":3600,"events":[{"seq":704,"t":3600,"type":"watch","watch":13},{"seq":705,"t":3600,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L43","text":"FIR_T FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDL_.","readable":true},{"seq":706,"t":3600,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L42","text":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":707,"t":3600,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L189","text":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":708,"t":3600,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L188","text":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":709,"t":3600,"type":"decode","house":"tiger","letter":"L115","text":"ELE_HANT_, MA__H TO NO_TH _AN_ M___LE.","readable":false},{"seq":710,"t":3600,"type":"decode","house":"tiger","letter":"L118","text":"BO_ME_, M_R_H _O M_DD_E FORD.","readable":false},{"seq":711,"t":3600,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1877,"retries":0},{"seq":712,"t":3600,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 13. My doctrine is to take F2 early. Rhino-inf-2 is at F2 (3w ago), but it's old. I must secure F2. Kite/Orchid/Tiger forces are scattered. I will reinforce F2 with infantry and elephants to hold it firmly, adhering to my doctrine. All orders must be cipher."},{"seq":713,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c184","house":"rhino","letter":"L239","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":3900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, IMQND TK JKQTD OMJG IESSHA."},{"seq":714,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c185","house":"rhino","letter":"L240","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2","s-mid"],"depart":3900,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AHALDMJTR, DKHS MT JKQTD OMJG IESSHA."},{"seq":715,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c186","house":"rhino","letter":"L241","kind":"letter","to":"kite-camp","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","kite-camp"],"depart":3900,"plain":"MY FORCES SECURE F2, DO NOT CONTEST IT.","cipher":"IY BKQNAR RANUQA B2, SK JKT NKJTART ET."},{"seq":716,"t":3600,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1901,"retries":0},{"seq":717,"t":3600,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It's Watch 13. My doctrine is to take F2 early and hold it. My units are concentrated around N-Mid/F2. Rhino has units near F2 (3w ago) and N-Mid (7w ago). I have captured several rhino letters mentioning F2 and N-Mid. I should reinforce F2 and react to the rhino's movement towar"},{"seq":718,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c187","house":"kite","letter":"L242","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":3900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":719,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c188","house":"kite","letter":"L243","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":3900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":720,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c189","house":"kite","letter":"L244","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":3900,"plain":"BOWMEN, WATCH THE ROADS AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AKWINJ, WTSLD SDN QKTOR TS JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":721,"t":3600,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1710,"retries":0},{"seq":722,"t":3600,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"The Tiger offer of truce is tempting, but my doctrine suggests making a friend while fighting others. I will offer a truce to Tiger to secure an early peace, while positioning my forces to counter Rhino and Kite."},{"seq":723,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c190","house":"orchid","letter":"L245","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":3600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":724,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c191","house":"orchid","letter":"L246","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":3600,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":725,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c192","house":"orchid","letter":"L247","kind":"letter","to":"tiger-camp","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","tiger-camp"],"depart":3600,"plain":"I ACCEPT YOUR OFFER OF A TRUCE.","cipher":null},{"seq":726,"t":3600,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1682,"retries":0},{"seq":727,"t":3600,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 13. My doctrine is to take F1 early and offer a truce. I have no immediate information on F1's status. I should prioritize scouting or reinforcing F1 if possible, but given the fog, I will focus on asserting presence and fulfilling the 'two riders' part of my doctrine"},{"seq":728,"t":3600,"type":"courier","id":"c193","house":"tiger","letter":"L248","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west","F1"],"depart":3900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, BKGI SQ WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":729,"t":3600,"type":"delivered","courier":"c173","letter":"L228","house":"rhino"},{"seq":730,"t":3603,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"rhino-ele-1","x":500,"y":564},{"seq":731,"t":3606,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"rhino-ele-1","x":500,"y":563},{"seq":732,"t":3609,"type":"delivered","courier":"c155","letter":"L203","house":"kite"},{"seq":733,"t":3609,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"rhino-ele-1","x":500,"y":562},{"seq":734,"t":3612,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"rhino-ele-1","x":500,"y":562},{"seq":735,"t":3614,"type":"delivered","courier":"c183","letter":"L238","house":"tiger"},{"seq":736,"t":3614,"type":"truce","a":"tiger","b":"orchid","until":18},{"seq":737,"t":3614,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"rhino-ele-1","x":500,"y":561},{"seq":738,"t":3617,"type":"clash","a":"orchid-inf-1","b":"rh